{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02689","headline":"文德皇后挽歌 · 朱子奢","name":"文德皇后挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神京背紫陌，缟驷结行輈。\n北去横桥道，西分清渭流。\n寒光向垄没，霜气入松楸。\n今日泉台路，非是濯龙游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱子奢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}